{"summary":"A tropical pixel fishing RPG!","description":"Fishing Paradiso is a unique narrative-driven fishing RPG with a strong story line. Enhance your fishing abilities by completing fishing quests and discover over 100 species of fish!\n\nIn heaven, fishing is a little different than how it is on earth…..as you’ll find out playing a young boy, who is woken up by a “birdy”, finding himself lost on a tropical island. To satisfy your appetite, you must learn how to fish.\n\nThis game will also serve as a sequel to the strong narrative-based game, “Bear’s Restaurant”, and there will be many characters from that adventure, such as “Mr. Bear” and “Cat”, making some appearances.\n\nUncover the tales of a mysterious big fish, a conspiracy of Angels, and even a rocket flying to outer space…..This adventure will not be so simple!","esrbNotes":"Violent References","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0KfBMmSWKME?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/J3wo8UoIO75tTJtbepNrExqdDePd-C3o3ovQh8lmMV49dOtbcxcMSScidZDQTAd7er0b1Tyhf4OWFG5NXhpdOQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ROhFlXNG1M1vPludOKswjwLSlUc7Zz8MOmTZl43hFjOyhOroEr8xb0ICqNgk6wb1zCFhok2UE2D2fUY9PMcU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/78M4HjlP308mdGQ3EHcaKsLbqgkQ5X2GWK5U6IaUyyJpkDVXdGUZWFqgyGZ4UXd5dkxplzTLzffi5h4L0HTb","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SrIjsogh-l_O1dxWIOSF1DJbpGIL_UdAClgNoveZsAbPX_E4-NKoYqvQ0S9cMeflavkRG9XB8RP7Wj07O74ISA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m0I_0FXtDdIHXwGgEBqWZ6rrSF75ZfKb0H_IngFxwHe3y2QkBOR1b7xiMoITl4k9KipdKm3EUOLLd7bUEGYlOw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FCnIF5YsX6378EVHdJ5Q2ncczTMSLI-O5yaFEsY6AI638OnszPAeAR3D_daaYPeW7F3KXiXMtTGbmYwMu5pr","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3L5HadnKBw4Jngv0ampfKN4KxgGNV7qgBqJh2W6hdPqeO9ysjOrhSCS3xqDdlncuXlxhHxtE9KJmiYXWB8RqVg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZZL2mSpZJHrYs1jn_H83m2kfF_khNICxgg4YIjTZ